            frame.RX_UE_INFORMATION_TAG = tag;
        }
    }
}
```
Note that the C implementation uses a fixed-size array to store the dynamically allocated `NFAPI_RX_FRAME_INFO` structures, while the Rust implementation uses a hash map to store them. The Rust implementation also includes methods for setting and retrieving the values of the `CRC_INDICATION_REL8_TAG`, `RNTI`, and `RX_UE_INFORMATION_TAG` fields directly on the `NFAPI_RX_FRAME_INFO` struct.']

